tool: informal 0.1.0; 3 s for each property; informal-kind, and informal-ic3 on the liveness rows
== Booleans and sampled-value functions
  a boolean e                                      yes                                    proven   cex, depth 10
  a parameter by name, q <= LIM                    yes                                    proven   cex, depth 10
  a signal of an instance below, u_leaf.hid        yes                                    proven   cex, depth 1
  $past(x)                                         yes                                    proven   cex, depth 1
  $past(x, 2)                                      yes                                    proven   cex, depth 1
  $rose(x)                                         yes                                    proven   cex, depth 1
  $fell(x)                                         yes                                    proven   cex, depth 1
  $stable(x)                                       yes                                    proven   cex, depth 1
  $changed(x)                                      yes                                    proven   cex, depth 1
  $onehot(x), $onehot0(x)                          yes                                    proven   cex, depth 1
  $countones(x)                                    yes                                    proven   cex, depth 8
  $bits(x)                                         yes                                    proven   cex, depth 1
  x inside {[lo:hi]}                               yes                                    proven   cex, depth 10
  $isunknown(x)                                    no: error at prove                     —        —
      not supported yet: $isunknown requires allow_four_state_ops
== Clock, reset, implication and delay
  @(posedge clk) e                                 yes                                    proven   cex, depth 10
  disable iff (rst)                                yes                                    proven   cex, depth 10
  @(negedge clk) e                                 yes                                    proven   cex, depth 19
  a |-> b                                          yes                                    proven   cex, depth 9
  a |=> b                                          yes                                    proven   cex, depth 2
  fixed delay a ##1 b                              yes                                    proven   cex, depth 3
  a ##0 b                                          yes                                    proven   cex, depth 2
  ranged delay ##[1:2] b                           yes                                    proven   cex, depth 3
  unbounded delay ##[1:$] b                        no: error at prove                     —        —
      not supported yet: the delay range [1:$]
== Repetition and the sequence operators
  a[*3]                                            yes                                    proven   cex, depth 4
  a[*1:3]                                          yes                                    proven   cex, depth 4
  goto repetition a[->2]                           no: refused at the command             —        —
      `[->` is not supported yet in a property
  nonconsecutive repetition a[=2]                  no: refused at the command             —        —
      `[=` is not supported yet in a property
  sequence and                                     yes                                    proven   cex, depth 3
  sequence or                                      yes                                    proven   cex, depth 2
  intersect                                        yes                                    proven   cex, depth 2
  within                                           yes                                    proven   cex, depth 3
  throughout                                       yes                                    proven   cex, depth 3
  first_match                                      yes                                    proven   cex, depth 3
== Property operators with a bound
  nexttime p                                       yes                                    proven   cex, depth 2
  nexttime [2] p                                   yes                                    proven   cex, depth 3
  always [0:2] p                                   yes                                    proven   cex, depth 11
  s_eventually [0:7] p                             yes                                    proven   cex, depth 7
  p until q                                        yes                                    proven   cex, depth 6
  p until_with q                                   yes                                    proven   cex, depth 10
  strong(s) of a bounded sequence                  yes                                    proven   cex, depth 3
  always p under an implication                    no: error at prove                     —        —
      not supported yet: `always` with no upper bound
  not p                                            no: refused at the command             —        —
      `not` is not supported yet in a property
  property iff                                     no: error at prove                     —        —
      not supported yet: property `iff`
  property implies                                 no: refused at the command             —        —
      unknown name(s) in module probe: implies
  property if ... else                             no: error at prove                     —        —
      not supported yet: property `if`
  accept_on                                        no: refused at the command             —        —
      `accept_on` is not supported yet in a property
  followed-by a #-# b, a #=# b                     no: refused at the command             —        —
      `#-#` is not supported yet in a property
== Liveness
  s_eventually p                                   yes                                    proven   cex, depth 26
  p s_until q                                      yes                                    proven   cex, depth 7
  p s_until_with q                                 yes                                    proven   cex, depth 8
  fairness, assume {s_eventually p}                yes                                    proven   cex, depth 26
